**Step 1: Bug Scenario Image Analysis & Root Cause Reasoning**

The image shows Apex code being highlighted as Java, but the language label is "Apex". The bug report discusses whether to add Apex as a new language or alias it to Java, since their syntax is very similar. The user wants Apex to be supported as a language in the syntax highlighter, but currently, there is no dedicated Apex language definition—only Java.

**Root Cause:**  
The syntax highlighter does not recognize "apex" as a language, so code blocks labeled as "apex" are not highlighted unless aliased to Java. The solution is to alias Apex to Java in the language loader, so that when "apex" is requested, it loads the Java definition.

